<p>SocialsForce is an independent digital publication covering technology, artificial intelligence, gaming, social networks and internet culture. Our goal is to explain what is happening online quickly, clearly and with context.</p>
<h2>Editorial principles</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Accuracy:</strong> we check sources and correct errors openly.</li>
    <li><strong>Transparency:</strong> automated tools may help us research and draft, but every article is reviewed and published under our editorial responsibility.</li>
    <li><strong>Independence:</strong> advertising and sponsored content are always clearly labelled and never decide our coverage.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Corrections</h2>
<p>If you spot a mistake, write to <%= legal.email %> with the article link and we will review it.</p>
<p>Want to reach us? Visit the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
